# ---------------- Arcade_Spawner.events (Task 7 Part G3 + G4 phases 1-2) ----------------
# Every few seconds, while the player is close enough, put another enemy on the floor ahead.
# `EnemiesAlive` is a global the enemy sheet decrements on death, so the lane cannot swamp.
# The lane's globals are also seeded here (`EnemiesAlive`, and the `Combo` counter the enemy
# sheet raises): the spawner is the one actor that exists exactly once in the scene, so the
# Combo decay also lives here — in the shared enemy sheet every clone would decay it.
#
# Phase 2 (variety): the lane mixes the three types by cadence instead of at random — a Zombie
# every 3 s, a Knife every 6 s, a Brute every 9 s, all sharing the same `EnemiesAlive` cap. Each
# template actor is named after its type (`Zombie`, `Knife`, `Brute`) so the shared enemy sheet
# reads the stats from the name and the `kills <Type>` counters stay separate.
#
# `me is near player by 200` works as a CONDITION here (a `when every` line plus a gate), which
# is what makes the spawner repeat instead of firing once on the `near` enter-edge. Lowercase
# `player` resolves to the nearest player in conditions too, so the sheet keeps working if the
# scene names the hero something else.
#
# SETUP (editor): the scene's `Arcade_Spawner` actor carries an EventSheet with Event File =
# Arcade_Spawner; `SpawnAhead` is an EmptyActor where the clones appear.

# Zeroed once per play session, so the first `add` to either counter reads a real value instead
# of an unset global (which reads 0 and warns once).
when me appears
  set EnemiesAlive to 0
  set Combo to 0

when every 3 seconds
  me is near player by 200
  unless EnemiesAlive is higher than 3
  add 1 to EnemiesAlive
  spawn Zombie at SpawnAhead
  print "Spawner: one more zombie ahead"

when every 6 seconds
  me is near player by 200
  unless EnemiesAlive is higher than 3
  add 1 to EnemiesAlive
  spawn Knife at SpawnAhead
  print "Spawner: a knife is closing in"

when every 9 seconds
  me is near player by 200
  unless EnemiesAlive is higher than 3
  add 1 to EnemiesAlive
  spawn Brute at SpawnAhead
  print "Spawner: a brute lumbers in"

# Combo decays one point every two seconds (G4 phase 1). One actor runs it, so the rate does not
# scale with the number of enemies on the floor.
when every 2 seconds
  Combo is higher than 0
  add -1 to Combo
